#
# It is IDENTICAL to run 17's, because the round-29 remediation changed CODE and added no
# tests — R29-04 renamed a test; R29-05, R29-06 and R29-08 are code fixes with no tests at all.
# **So the count check had nothing to detect and the membership check had nothing new within
# the run.** A green here says the suite still passes on changed code, which is worth having,
# and says nothing about whether the changed code is covered. This was written into the
# expectation BEFORE the run rather than discovered after.
#
#   MEMBERSHIP: root 213 identities / unpriv 213, ZERO in either direction, rc 0.
